<title>HONG KONG: Champion Tech 1995/96 net up 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Champion Tech 1995/96 net up 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   16.1	 vs 14.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	  vs 1.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  16.03 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    246.38     vs 200.39</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,025.19   vs 766.44</p>
<p>    Company name		 Champion Technology Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  December 19-30, 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 30, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Champion Technology is a telepaging group.</p>
<p>The company proposed a distribution of a bonus issue of one 1998 warrant for every five shares held. Each warrant which expires on June 30, 1998, entitles holders to subscribe one company share at HK$1.18 per share subject to adjustment.</p>
<p>The exceptional item represents costs incurred on the restructuring of the group's manufacturing operations located principally in Europe during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.3 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 1.3 cents) vs 3.1 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
